OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 10 DEC
OL,4,G2300FAsian Network Motivation with
OL,5,     FTrishala Lakhani
OL,6,     GTrishala Lakhani celebrates what
OL,7,     Git means to be British Asian -
OL,8,     Gexploring identity, culture, and
OL,9,     Gpride through real talk, good
OL,10,     Gvibes, and music. It's a
OL,11,     Gsuperpower.
OL,12,G0000FAsian Network's Shades On Mix
OL,13,     Fwith DJ Manara
OL,14,     GDJ Manara goes in the mix
OL,15,     Gbringing you the best in
OL,16,     Gunderground production and vocals
OL,17,     Gfrom the likes of Czetan, Prozak,
OL,18,     GDJ Swami and many more. Contains
OL,19,     Gstrong language.
